{"id":"bbded1dd14481b99","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-comonad-coalgebras.md","title":"Definition — 余代数范畴与余自由伴随","display":"Definition — 余代数范畴与余自由伴随","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-comonad-coalgebras","aliases":["14-df-comonad-coalgebras"],"display":"Definition — 余代数范畴与余自由伴随","source_ref":"V.8 coalgebras and cofree right adjoint, printed 249; adjunction formulas (14)–(15), printed 251; DjVu 130–131","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-comonad]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-comonad-coalgebras"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-comonad-coalgebras</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 余代数范畴与余自由伴随"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"V.8 coalgebras and cofree right adjoint, printed 249; adjunction formulas (14)–(15), printed 251; DjVu 130–131"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74836596676a64ea\" href=\"?note=74836596676a64ea\" title=\"14-df-comonad\">14-df-comonad</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(G,\\delta,\\varepsilon)\">\\((G,\\delta,\\varepsilon)\\)</span> 为范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 上的余单子。余代数对象为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=(A,a:A\\to GA)\">\\(K=(A,a:A\\to GA)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,L,H\">\\(K,L,H\\)</span> 为余代数对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_G\">\\(\\beta_G\\)</span> 提取其箭头的底层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_G,R_G\">\\(U_G,R_G\\)</span> 为以下遗忘、余自由函子。Hom 双射固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=(A,a)\">\\(K=(A,a)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\to B\">\\(f:A\\to B\\)</span> 为环境箭头，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:K\\to R_GB\">\\(h:K\\to R_GB\\)</span> 为余代数箭头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O^G=\\{(A,a)\\mid A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,GA)\\land\\varepsilon_A\\circ a=\\operatorname{id}_A\\land\\delta_A\\circ a=G(a)\\circ a\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O^G=\\{(A,a)\\mid A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,GA)\\land\\varepsilon_A\\circ a=\\operatorname{id}_A\\land\\delta_A\\circ a=G(a)\\circ a\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M^G=\\{((A,a),(B,b),f)\\mid(A,a),(B,b)\\in O^G\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\land b\\circ f=G(f)\\circ a\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M^G=\\{((A,a),(B,b),f)\\mid(A,a),(B,b)\\in O^G\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\land b\\circ f=G(f)\\circ a\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d^G((K,L,f))=K,\\quad c^G((K,L,f))=L,\\quad\\beta_G((K,L,f))=f,\\quad i^G((A,a))=((A,a),(A,a),\\operatorname{id}_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d^G((K,L,f))=K,\\quad c^G((K,L,f))=L,\\quad\\beta_G((K,L,f))=f,\\quad i^G((A,a))=((A,a),(A,a),\\operatorname{id}_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma^G((L,H,g),(K,L,f))=(K,H,g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f),\\quad\\mathcal C_G=(O^G,M^G,d^G,c^G,i^G,\\gamma^G),\\quad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_G}(K,L)=\\{v\\in M^G:d^G(v)=K\\land c^G(v)=L\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma^G((L,H,g),(K,L,f))=(K,H,g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f),\\quad\\mathcal C_G=(O^G,M^G,d^G,c^G,i^G,\\gamma^G),\\quad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_G}(K,L)=\\{v\\in M^G:d^G(v)=K\\land c^G(v)=L\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_{G,0}((A,a))=A,\\quad U_{G,1}((K,L,f))=f,\\quad R_{G,0}(B)=(GB,\\delta_B),\\quad R_{G,1}(f)=(R_{G,0}(A),R_{G,0}(B),G(f))\\quad(f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_{G,0}((A,a))=A,\\quad U_{G,1}((K,L,f))=f,\\quad R_{G,0}(B)=(GB,\\delta_B),\\quad R_{G,1}(f)=(R_{G,0}(A),R_{G,0}(B),G(f))\\quad(f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_G=(U_{G,0},U_{G,1}),\\qquad R_G=(R_{G,0},R_{G,1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_G=(U_{G,0},U_{G,1}),\\qquad R_G=(R_{G,0},R_{G,1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C_G),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(U_G,\\mathcal C_G,\\mathcal C),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(R_G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C_G),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsAdjunction}(U_G,R_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C_G),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(U_G,\\mathcal C_G,\\mathcal C),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(R_G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C_G),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsAdjunction}(U_G,R_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{K,B}(f)=(K,R_G(B),G(f)\\circ a),\\qquad\\Psi_{K,B}(h)=\\varepsilon_B\\circ\\beta_G(h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_{K,B}(f)=(K,R_G(B),G(f)\\circ a),\\qquad\\Psi_{K,B}(h)=\\varepsilon_B\\circ\\beta_G(h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{K,B}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_G}(K,R_G(B)),\\qquad\\Psi_{K,B}=\\Phi_{K,B}^{-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_{K,B}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_G}(K,R_G(B)),\\qquad\\Psi_{K,B}=\\Phi_{K,B}^{-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>余代数对象和箭头均保留结构标签，余自由函子对箭头返回三元组。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 真正返回余代数箭头；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span> 经底层投影再与余单位复合。</p>\n<p>余结合律与余单位律保证余自由对象是余代数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 的自然性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(f)\">\\(G(f)\\)</span> 为余代数态射。两个伴随公式互逆，分别使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 的自然性与余代数余单位律，以及余代数态射律与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\varepsilon\\circ\\delta=1\">\\(G\\varepsilon\\circ\\delta=1\\)</span>。所以遗忘函子位于伴随左侧：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_G\\dashv R_G\">\\(U_G\\dashv R_G\\)</span>，方向与代数情形相反。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，V.8，余代数定义 (8)、遗忘函子与余自由右伴随在印刷249页（DjVu130右页）；印刷251页（DjVu131右页）公式 (14)–(15) 再次明确使用这一伴随及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\mapsto G(f)\\circ a\">\\(f\\mapsto G(f)\\circ a\\)</span> 的转置。原稿记录曾完整读取本地 OCR 的129–131图页。此处保留现有范畴、箭头及双射定义，仅明确一元函数对完整对象对或箭头三元组的作用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-comonad","status":"resolved","id":"74836596676a64ea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-comonad]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(G,\\delta,\\varepsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"K=(A,a:A\\to GA)","display":false},{"tex":"K,L,H","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"U_G,R_G","display":false},{"tex":"K=(A,a)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"f:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"h:K\\to R_GB","display":false},{"tex":"O^G=\\{(A,a)\\mid A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,GA)\\land\\varepsilon_A\\circ a=\\operatorname{id}_A\\land\\delta_A\\circ a=G(a)\\circ a\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"M^G=\\{((A,a),(B,b),f)\\mid(A,a),(B,b)\\in O^G\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\land b\\circ f=G(f)\\circ a\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"d^G((K,L,f))=K,\\quad c^G((K,L,f))=L,\\quad\\beta_G((K,L,f))=f,\\quad i^G((A,a))=((A,a),(A,a),\\operatorname{id}_A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\gamma^G((L,H,g),(K,L,f))=(K,H,g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f),\\quad\\mathcal C_G=(O^G,M^G,d^G,c^G,i^G,\\gamma^G),\\quad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_G}(K,L)=\\{v\\in M^G:d^G(v)=K\\land c^G(v)=L\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"U_{G,0}((A,a))=A,\\quad U_{G,1}((K,L,f))=f,\\quad R_{G,0}(B)=(GB,\\delta_B),\\quad R_{G,1}(f)=(R_{G,0}(A),R_{G,0}(B),G(f))\\quad(f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)).","display":true},{"tex":"U_G=(U_{G,0},U_{G,1}),\\qquad R_G=(R_{G,0},R_{G,1}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C_G),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(U_G,\\mathcal C_G,\\mathcal C),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(R_G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C_G),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsAdjunction}(U_G,R_G).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_{K,B}(f)=(K,R_G(B),G(f)\\circ a),\\qquad\\Psi_{K,B}(h)=\\varepsilon_B\\circ\\beta_G(h).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_{K,B}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C_G}(K,R_G(B)),\\qquad\\Psi_{K,B}=\\Phi_{K,B}^{-1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"G(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"G\\varepsilon\\circ\\delta=1","display":false},{"tex":"U_G\\dashv R_G","display":false},{"tex":"f\\mapsto G(f)\\circ a","display":false}],"bytes":3451,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-309","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-comonad-coalgebras|df-215 — 余代数范畴与余自由伴随]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-comonad-coalgebras]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-comonad-coalgebras]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-comonad-coalgebras]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-310","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-comonad-coalgebras|df-215 — 余代数范畴与余自由伴随]]"}],"outgoing":["d2b4e5cf16585f95","74836596676a64ea"]}